  "summary": "Weightlifter Mirabai Chanu won India\u2019s first gold medal at the 2026 Commonwealth Games, Akashvani News reports. The victory provides an early highlight for India at the Games and was widely celebrated by fans and officials.",
  "content": "Mirabai Chanu clinched India\u2019s first gold medal at the Commonwealth Games 2026 in weightlifting, Akashvani News reported. The result, announced in the News On AIR bulletin on July 27, 2026, represents the country\u2019s first top-podium finish at these Games.\n\nThe victory was greeted with widespread applause across India, with fans and sporting officials hailing Chanu\u2019s performance. Observers noted the significance of an early gold for the Indian contingent as the Games progressed.\n\nAkashvani News carried the brief report in its Evening News bulletin. The item provided the key outcome and the date but did not include detailed competition statistics or weight-class specifics in the short bulletin.\n\nLast Updated: 27th Jul 2026\n\nDownloadMobile App\n\nPlay Audio Evening News\n\nNo posts found.\n\nPrivacy Policy| Copyright \u00a9 2026 News On Air. All rights reserved",
